# Built by tools/build.sh from GitViewScripts/*.cs
GitView/GitViewScripts.dll
GitView/GitViewScripts.dll.mdb
*.pdb

# Written by the mod at runtime
GitView/settings.txt

# tools/make_icon.py --preview, for looking at the icon while working on it.
# The icons it really writes, GitView/Resources/*.png, are kept.
icon-preview.png

# Anything the build or a debugging session leaves behind. tools/build.sh works
# in $TMPDIR, which is normally outside the repo -- .scratch is where it goes
# when it cannot be, and it holds a copy of the compiler host as well as whatever
# was being looked at that day.
.scratch/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.log

# Besiege's screenshots, which is how a problem gets described in this repo:
# they are dropped in the working copy, looked at, and are of no use afterwards.
# Named by the game as <yyyymmddhhmmss>_<n>.jpg, so a picture that is meant to be
# kept -- docs/something.png -- is not caught by this.
[0-9]*_[0-9].jpg
[0-9]*_[0-9].png

# Editors and desktops
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

*.pyc
__pycache__/
